# draft
// FIRST DRAFT (game phase 8, docs/tech-spec.md §74): rewrite or sign off. Voice: docs/voice.md. Flags: docs/story-drafts.md.
// Night 8, after the night's own scene, while Ulf is at home: his friend Steinar, and a favour.
EXTERNAL flag(name)
# fx: flag errand_steinar
A raven comes after the stranger has gone, with a letter from Ulf, written small to fit.
"You'll remember Steinar Kolsson, who worked the bellows next to me at Hallbjorn's. He went with the jarl's cousin to the fighting at the ford, and he didn't come back." # speaker: ulf
"The cousin tells everyone Steinar died facing them. His mother keeps the story like a coin in her fist. But the cousin tells a better story every time he tells it." # speaker: ulf
"If Steinar comes to your gate, look at his back for me. I want to know. I don't know what I'll do when I do." # speaker: ulf
* [Promise to look.]
  # fx: flag steinar_promised
  You write that you'll look. It's the easiest promise you've made since you got your wings.
* [Ask him what he'll do with it.]
  "Nothing," he writes back. "Or everything. Look, and then I'll know which." # speaker: ulf
- -> END
